    {
      "id": "tt12696480:8:1",
      "title": "Anna Oxa, Ignazio La Russa, Wanda Nara and Naike Rivelli",
      "season": 8,
      "episode": 1,
      "number": 1,
      "released": "2023-02-21T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "The first \"belve\" guests of Francesca Fagnani will be Senate President Ignazio La Russa, Wanda Nara, Anna Oxa, who gives Francesca the first and only interview after her participation at the Sanremo Song Contest 2023, and Naike Rivelli. Among the novelties some moments dedicated to comedy, entrusted to the satire of Ubaldo Pantani and the incursion of some young and talented revelations of the web. Among the new entries, in fact, also Valeria De Angelis and Maria Chiara Cicolani, the two Roman girls who with their Instagram page \"Eterobasiche\" give life to an amazing parody of the \"basic straight men\", bringing to the scene tics and stereotypes of conversations between men on topics such as football, gender odds and Lgbtq+. Finally, there is also room for Cristina Di Tella, the thermolese girl, TikTok star, able to perfectly replicate movements, grimaces and vocal intonations of the television characters.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt12696480/8/1/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 4252062
    },
