      "overview": "Guests of the episode are Al Bano, Bianca Balti and Giacomo Urtis. The episode also enriches the story of Michela Andreozzi and Ubaldo Pantani with an ironic sketch, and finally space for the comic raids of the Eterobasiche and Cristina Di Tella.",
